WEBVTT

00:03:28.597 --> 00:03:33.497
and help people move away from
problematic feelings of shame

00:03:33.530 --> 00:03:36.263
to being more self-compassionate

00:03:36.297 --> 00:03:40.730
and more realistic about
what our responsibilities are.

00:03:40.763 --> 00:03:46.697
It could be a wise person that you trust.

00:03:46.697 --> 00:03:49.563
One of the things about shame is,
when we talk about it,

00:03:49.597 --> 00:03:52.430
it tends to dispel it a little bit,

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:55.230
make it easier to deal with
if you put it into words.

00:03:55.230 --> 00:03:58.363
We often don't talk about shame at all.

00:03:58.930 --> 00:04:05.630
It's sort ... of we're almost
a shame-phobic society, I think.